<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 4.70 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 4.70 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 4.70 percent in the week ending July 5 from 5.91 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	July 5     June 28	July 4, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +4.70	+5.91	  +5.79</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  325.0	324.5	  310.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for the week ended July 4, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
